sign-in with Apple was a feature  announced by Apple and 2019 and it  allows users to authenticate into a web  or mobile application using their Apple  ID it works just like other one-click  social sign-in methods like Google  Facebook Twitter etc to implement this  method in your firebase app you'll first  need to have an Apple Developer account  which will run you about $99 per year  now head over to your Apple developer  portal create a new app ID or update an  existing one to use the sign-in with  Apple capability from there you'll  create a new service ID and configure it  to work with your domain enter the  hosting URLs from your firebase project  then register the service ID now we need  to verify ownership of this domain with  Apple go back to the configuration for  the service ID you'll see the option to  download a file save that file under the  well-known directory in your public  hosting folder then upload this file to  firebase hosting by running firebase  deploy from the command line click  verify and you should get a green check  mark now the last thing we need is a  private key click on keys and then  generate a new one for Apple sign-in go  ahead and download this file somewhere  securely on your system then open it in  your editor at this point we can go to  the authentication tab on the firebase  console and click enable for Apple  sign-in enter your team ID as well as  the information from the private key and  now we just need to add a little bit of  JavaScript to our front-end app with  firebase initialized we'll make a  reference to auth then we'll define an  async function called sign in with Apple  it instantiates an auth provider for  apple calm then awaits the auth sign in  with pop-up method this prompts the user  to login with their Apple ID and when  they're done they'll be logged into the  firebase app and will have access to  their user data on the result this has  been Apple sign-in with firebase in 100  seconds and I realize that was super  fast so head over to fire ship IO to get  a full step-by-step breakdown of the  process thanks for watching make sure to  LIKE and subscribe and I will see you in  the next one
 

